    {
      "id": "REWARD-TRUTH",
      "priority": "P2",
      "status": "FIXED_VERIFIED",
      "evidence": "Deep gambit and relic exchanges promised and reported a lower fixed rarity than the actual generated chest. The current display uses minimum guarantees before paying and real committed rarity afterwards. Existing saved pending mystery descriptions are corrected only during read-only presentation.",
