    {
      "id": "BOSS-TAIL-POLICY",
      "priority": "P2",
      "status": "NOT_AN_ESTABLISHED_ENGINE_DEFECT",
      "evidence": "Original 215-floor 41-roll tail opens with 1 invested / 369 unspent points; original 305-floor 50-roll tail with 1 invested / 470 unspent. Same snapshots with original-priority full investments end in 2 / 1 rolls. Pure power investments end in 7 / 11 rolls. No balance numbers changed."
    },
    {
      "id": "ECONOMY-POLICY",
      "priority": "P2",
      "status": "OPEN_RISK_WITH_POLICY_LIMITS",
      "evidence": "The inherited policy stops weapon forging around +9, never forges armor/relics, and never fuses legendary+ spares. It leaves 540 / 578 such spare items and 1.71M / 2.24M gold. This is evidence of policy-limited spending, not sufficient proof to change economy or prices."
    },
